@startuml Create Group Chat by User
actor User
participant ": ChatInboxPage " as ChatInboxPage
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": ChatController " as ChatController
participant ": ChatService " as ChatService
participant ": ChatRepository " as ChatRepository
participant ": UserService " as UserService
database Database

User->ChatInboxPage: 1. Select multiple participants (>=3 users) and click "Create Group Chat"
    activate User
    activate ChatInboxPage

ChatInboxPage->ChatInboxPage: 2. Validate participants (at least 3 users)

alt valid participants (>=3)
    ChatInboxPage->Router: 10.1 Send POST /api/chat/rooms with ChatRoom (Name, ParticipantIds)
    deactivate ChatInboxPage
    activate Router

    Router->ChatController: 10.1.1 Route Request to Controller
    deactivate Router
    activate ChatController

    ChatController->ChatService: 10.1.2 CreateRoom(room)
    deactivate ChatController
    activate ChatService

    ChatService->ChatService: 10.1.3 Check if room.ParticipantIds.Count > 2

    ChatService->ChatService: 10.1.4 Create new ChatRoom (group chat always creates new)

    ChatService->ChatRepository: 10.1.5 CreateRoom(room)
    activate ChatRepository

    ChatRepository->Database: 10.1.6 INSERT ChatRoom into MongoDB (Id, Name, ParticipantIds, UnreadCounts, CreatedAt)
    activate Database

    Database-->ChatRepository: 10.1.7 Room Created Successfully
    deactivate Database

    ChatRepository-->ChatService: 10.1.8 Return ChatRoom
    deactivate ChatRepository

    ChatService->ChatService: 10.1.9 MapToRoomDto(room)

    loop for each participant ID
        ChatService->UserService: 10.1.10 GetUserByIdAsync(participantId)
            activate UserService
        UserService->Database: 10.1.11 Query User by Id
            activate Database
        Database-->UserService: 10.1.12 Return User data
            deactivate Database
        UserService-->ChatService: 10.1.13 Return User (FullName, AvatarUrl)
            deactivate UserService
    end

    ChatService->ChatService: 10.1.14 Create ChatRoomDto (Id, ParticipantIds, ParticipantNames, ParticipantAvatars, LastMessage, UpdatedAt, UnreadCount)

    ChatService-->ChatController: 10.1.15 Return ChatRoomDto
    activate ChatController
    deactivate ChatService

    ChatController-->Router: 10.1.16 Send Success Response (200)
    activate Router
    deactivate ChatController

    Router-->ChatInboxPage: 10.1.17 Group Chat Created Successfully
    activate ChatInboxPage
    deactivate Router

    ChatInboxPage->ChatInboxPage: 10.1.18 Extract roomId from response

    ChatInboxPage->ChatInboxPage: 10.1.19 Navigate to /chat/{roomId}

    ChatInboxPage-->User: 10.1.20 Show Group Chat Room
    deactivate ChatInboxPage
    deactivate User
else invalid participants (<3)
    ChatInboxPage->ChatInboxPage: 10.2 Show error (Need at least 3 participants for group chat)
    ChatInboxPage-->User: 10.2.1 Show error toast
    deactivate ChatInboxPage
    deactivate User
end
@enduml




